[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844407769","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623#issuecomment-2844407769","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105623","id":2844407769,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pijfZ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T08:55:37Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T08:55:37Z","body":"It could be better if the areas above and below the button were clickable (when the group is hovered).\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/321062f8-939f-4add-bd33-dbbd13c82c35\r\n\r\nNavigation checkbox in TileMapLayer has no effect:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/356de354-8293-47eb-913b-4e1524c719fa)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844407769/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844422758","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623#issuecomment-2844422758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105623","id":2844422758,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pinJm","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T09:06:36Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T09:07:19Z","body":"Worth noting a general pain point that doesn't come into discussion often, but is particularly relevant in this PR:\r\n\r\nFor a lot of these kinds of groups, all properties contained within them are saved and stored on disk, **even if they're not shown in the Inspector**. From an UX perspective, properties that are stored **should** be displayed in the editor anyway, but not be editable.\r\n\r\nThe reason this may be a \"pain point\" is because, [last time I pointed this out](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/editor?msg=yRP74Ckd74GDCZ3QS), there was disagreement on how these kinds of grouped properties should work.\r\nI still stand by the fact that they should not be stored _at all_ when the group is disabled, but that's a change in behaviour.\r\n- See also https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4823","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844422758/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844509147","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623#issuecomment-2844509147","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105623","id":2844509147,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pi8Pb","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T09:32:04Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T09:32:04Z","body":"You should remove `notify_property_list_changed()` calls too.\r\n\r\nThe section sometimes gets bugged and is unfolded when disabled:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/885773c0-e1a9-4337-8234-aaaf0a72c788)\r\n\r\nIt can happen when you undo/redo enabling or unfold and disable the property externally.\r\n\r\n> From an UX perspective, properties that are stored should be displayed in the editor anyway, but not be editable.\r\n\r\nThe disabled section will show change count, which is better than nothing.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2730d260-cbdb-43c7-bbda-2315f6052da5)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844509147/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2846774925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623#issuecomment-2846774925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105623","id":2846774925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6prlaN","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T09:24:26Z","updated_at":"2025-05-04T09:12:59Z","body":"Ok, I've made a few changes:\r\n\r\nThe `On` text is now localized and the clickable area increased to the whole height. I used `TTR` because `TTRC` was not updating when changing languages within the editor.\r\nThe toggle sections now work properly when properties included in them are favorited.\r\nEven if the section is not foldable, if it has the \"feature\" hint string then it will fold (to mimic the behavior of `_validate_properties`)\r\nThe undo/redo weirdness was likely due to the `update_tree` being called too much, but a fix was to update the folding behavior when the section is set up.\r\n\r\nKnown Issues:\r\n- [x] `On` text is also yellow when property_warning is shown. This should be a simple fix.\r\n- [x] The inspector's `update_tree` is called each time the section is toggled. This probably shouldn't happen, although is handy for the inspector section to communicate with the corresponding section in the `Favorites` tab.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2846774925/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2846812759","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623#issuecomment-2846812759","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105623","id":2846812759,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6prupX","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T09:44:39Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T09:44:39Z","body":"> I used TTR because TTRC was not updating when changing languages within the editor.\r\n\r\nTTRC should be only used when auto-translation is supported (e.g. when setting a text in Label). It's not supported when drawing raw string.\r\n\r\n> On text is also yellow when property_warning is shown. This should be a simple fix.\r\n\r\nI thought it's intentional.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2846812759/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2846822199","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623#issuecomment-2846822199","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105623","id":2846822199,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6prw83","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https: