)\r\n[17] DisplayServerWindows::_dispatch_input_events (C:\\godot_source\\platform\\windows\\display_server_windows.cpp:4385)\r\n[18] Input::_parse_input_event_impl (C:\\godot_source\\core\\input\\input.cpp:903)\r\n[19] Input::flush_buffered_events (C:\\godot_source\\core\\input\\input.cpp:1184)\r\n[20] DisplayServerWindows::process_events (C:\\godot_source\\platform\\windows\\display_server_windows.cpp:3798)\r\n[21] OS_Windows::run (C:\\godot_source\\platform\\windows\\os_windows.cpp:2272)\r\n[22] widechar_main (C:\\godot_source\\platform\\windows\\godot_windows.cpp:97)\r\n[23] _main (C:\\godot_source\\platform\\windows\\godot_windows.cpp:122)\r\n[24] main (C:\\godot_source\\platform\\windows\\godot_windows.cpp:136)\r\n[25] WinMain (C:\\godot_source\\platform\\windows\\godot_windows.cpp:150)\r\n[26] __scrt_common_main_seh (D:\\a\\_work\\1\\s\\src\\vctools\\crt\\vcstartup\\src\\startup\\exe_common.inl:288)\r\n[27] <couldn't map PC to fn name>\r\n-- END OF BACKTRACE --\r\n```\r\nJust clicked a Sprite2D.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848590788/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848795706","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623#issuecomment-2848795706","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105623","id":2848795706,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pzSw6","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-03T20:31:23Z","updated_at":"2025-05-04T10:25:19Z","body":"Should be fixed. I delayed hooking up the signals to notify a section that a property was changed (to display the `(2 changes)` text) so that it would only notify the section if it wasn't favorited (because favorited sections cannot be folded, so there is no point storing that information), which caused the regression because I was hooking up a EditorProperty signal to something that wasn't an EditorProperty.\r\n\r\nThis change also means that if a favorited property is edited, it won't show up in the `(_ changes)` for the related section. In my opinion this is better because before, a section could show as having changes made to it, but the changes were made in the favorites bar, not the direct children of the section.\r\n\r\nSections now update themselves by connecting to the `property_edited` signal, and updating when the corresponding property is edited (this works with the undo-redo system), meaning there is less need for global refreshes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848795706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2872606066","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623#issuecomment-2872606066","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105623","id":2872606066,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rOH1y","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-12T13:34:15Z","updated_at":"2025-05-12T13:35:39Z","body":"The text is not properly aligned vertically:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e12dc956-5465-4563-80e7-a850aca02247)\r\nMore obvious in other languages, where the text is longer:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa357dbb-45fd-45f9-8c96-4509e1de60bc)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2872606066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2899347298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623#issuecomment-2899347298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105623","id":2899347298,"node_id":"I